3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D22  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >以订单销售业务来举例：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >把源库中没有入边且有两条或两条以上出边的实体直接转换成链接表把订单明细转换成链接表</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >把源库中除第一步以外的外键关系转换成链接表。订单和客户之间建立链接表，产品和产品类型之间建立链接表。注意</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑"